@SimpleService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5095

### Check API liveness
GET {{SimpleService_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Read the development OpenAPI document
GET {{SimpleService_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Check the Problem Details response for an unknown route
GET {{SimpleService_HostAddress}}/does-not-exist
Accept: application/problem+json
